CONTROL FLOW
------------

1. Remote asset
   |
   +--> Continuously provides location telemetry through OpenNinja.

2. OpenNinja
   |
   +--> Reports current asset location and movement status.

3. Geofence Engine
   |
   +--> Compares asset location against authorized Emerald Retail zones.

4. Authorized Zone
   |
   +--> Asset remains within permitted boundary.
   |
   +--> Event is recorded as normal monitoring activity.

5. Unauthorized Zone
   |
   +--> Zone breach is generated.
   |
   +--> Event is immediately forwarded to the SOC.

6. SOC
   |
   +--> Initiates incident-response procedures.
   |
   +--> Determines whether the event represents a security incident.

7. GRC Evidence Store
   |
   +--> Retains asset, event, timestamp, zone, and response information.

8. Compliance Reporting
   |
   +--> Uses accumulated evidence to demonstrate continuous monitoring
       and support PE-20 assessment activities.



