## 9. Monitoring and Maintenance

### 9.1 Automation Health Monitoring

| Metric                | Threshold                                                                                                                                           | Alert                                                                                                                |
| --------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Job execution success | Any scheduled monitoring job fails, terminates unexpectedly, or exceeds its expected execution window                                               | SOC / Security Administrator alert                                                                                   |
| Data freshness        | No telemetry received from a monitored asset within the defined monitoring interval, or monitoring data exceeds the established freshness threshold | Security Administrator alert; investigate endpoint, agent, or communications failure                                 |
| Alert volume          | Significant deviation from established baseline, including an unexpected increase or decrease in RULE-003 alerts                                    | SOC alert; investigate potential configuration issue, geofence change, telemetry failure, or abnormal asset activity |


### 9.2 Ongoing Maintenance

| Activity                 | Frequency                                                                                              | Owner                        |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------- |
| Rule tuning              | Monthly and following confirmed false positives, false negatives, or significant environmental changes | Security Administrator       |
| Integration health check | Daily automated health check; formal review monthly                                                    | Security Administrator / SOC |
| Evidence review          | Monthly; additionally following security incidents or control failures                                 | GRC / Security Administrator |




